menu "CD player"

    config CD_HOSTNAME
        string "Network hostname"
        default "cdplayer"
        help
            DHCP and mDNS hostname. The OTA server is reachable as http://<hostname>.local/.

    config CD_WIFI_SSID
        string "Default Wi-Fi SSID"
        default ""
        help
            Used only when no credentials are stored in NVS. Credentials set with the
            serial command 'W' are stored in NVS and take precedence. Empty = Wi-Fi off until set.

    config CD_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Default Wi-Fi password"
        default ""

    config CD_AP_PASSWORD
        string "Setup access point password"
        default "cdplayer"
        help
            WPA2 password of the setup access point (CDPlayer-XXXX, 192.168.4.1), which starts when no
            Wi-Fi network is configured or the configured one can't be reached. It is shown on the
            display while the AP is on. At least 8 characters; shorter = open network (not recommended:
            the web UI has no login and allows firmware uploads).

    config CD_META_CONTACT
        string "Contact for the MusicBrainz User-Agent"
        default ""
        help
            MusicBrainz asks API clients to identify themselves with "app/version ( contact )",
            e.g. a project URL or an e-mail address. Optional.

endmenu
